@learningBaseUrl = https://learning.example.invalid
@serviceKeyId = progress-service-key-id
@serviceTimestamp = unix-timestamp-seconds
@serviceSignature = hmac-sha256-for-exact-method-path-query-and-empty-body

### Signed Learning outbox watermark (before must be RFC 3339 date-time)
GET {{learningBaseUrl}}/internal/outbox-watermark?before=2026-11-03T12%3A00%3A00.000Z
X-Service-Key-Id: {{serviceKeyId}}
X-Service-Timestamp: {{serviceTimestamp}}
X-Service-Signature: {{serviceSignature}}

# The signature must use sender "progress" or "maintainer", include the exact query string,
# and hash an empty request body. Replace the placeholders with values from the test environment.
